{%- comment -%}
  SYNOR DIARIES — HAVAMAN NU KHANU (chhapa na khune je chokathu hoy).

  Pehla paana par aa chokathu chhapa ni sauthi olkhaay evi cheez chhe. Andar
  havaman nahi, dispatch nu havaman: perfume kharekhar taapman ane bhej
  pramane badlaay chhe, etle aa aankda content chhe, sajavat nahi.

  Chokathu 3 khana ni line ma bandhaay chhe, etle jetla aankda hoy ene 3 na
  gunak sudhi khali khana thi bharva pade chhe — nahi to chokathu adhuru
  katayelu dekhaay. Chhapu pan e j kare chhe.

  Be thi ochha aankda hoy to chokathu aavtu j nathi: guide post par eni
  jarur nathi ane khali chokathu bhul jevu laage chhe.

  METAFIELDS (namespace `custom`):
    field_place · field_alt · field_temp · field_humidity · field_held
    field_asked · field_verdict

  Vaapar: {% render 'sa-blog-fieldbox', article: a, s: s %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign f_place = article.metafields.custom.field_place.value
  assign f_alt = article.metafields.custom.field_alt.value
  assign f_temp = article.metafields.custom.field_temp.value
  assign f_hum = article.metafields.custom.field_humidity.value
  assign f_held = article.metafields.custom.field_held.value
  assign f_asked = article.metafields.custom.field_asked.value
  assign f_verdict = article.metafields.custom.field_verdict.value

  assign want = s.lead_fields | default: 'temp,humidity,alt,held,asked,verdict' | split: ','
  assign filled = 0
-%}

{%- capture cells -%}
  {%- for k in want -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign key = k | strip
      assign lab = ''
      assign val = ''
      case key
        when 'temp'
          assign lab = 'Temp'
          assign val = f_temp
        when 'humidity'
          assign lab = 'Humid'
          assign val = f_hum
        when 'alt'
          assign lab = 'Alt'
          assign val = f_alt
        when 'held'
          assign lab = 'Held'
          assign val = f_held
        when 'asked'
          assign lab = 'Asked'
          assign val = f_asked
        when 'verdict'
          assign lab = 'Verdict'
          assign val = f_verdict
        when 'place'
          assign lab = 'Place'
          assign val = f_place
      endcase
    -%}
    {%- if val != blank -%}
      {%- assign filled = filled | plus: 1 -%}
      <div><b>{{ lab }}</b><s>{{ val }}</s></div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    3 na gunak sudhi khali khana. 5 aankda hoy to ek khana khali jaay, ane
    e chokathu tooti gayelu dekhaay — etle e khana bharvu pade.
  endcomment
  assign spare = filled | modulo: 3
  assign pad = 0
  if spare > 0
    assign pad = 3 | minus: spare
  endif
-%}

{%- if filled > 1 -%}
  <div class="np-wx">
    <div class="np-wx-h">
      <span>{{ s.word_field }}</span>
      {%- if f_place != blank -%}<span>{{ f_place }}</span>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="np-wx-g">
      {{ cells }}
      {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
        {%- if forloop.index <= pad -%}<div></div>{%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
